  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Pugazhraj vs The Designated Officer on 10 March, 2023 Author: B.Pugalendhi Bench: B.Pugalendhi WP(MD)No.21 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 10.03.2023 Coram: The Honourable Mr.Justice B.Pugalendhi WP(MD)No.21253/2014 Pugazhraj ...Petitio Vs 1.The Designated Officer, District Food Safety Wing, Virudhunagar District 2.The Food Safety Officer, Aruppukottai Block, Virudhunagar District. ...Respond Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution o to issue a Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus calling for the records relating to the notice dated 17.12.2014 issued by the first respond quash the same as illegal and direct the respondents to unseal the petitioners business premises, namely, T.M.Traders situated at Door 2/198, Periya Vallikulam Village, Viruthunagar District forthwith a consequently, direct the respondents to act in accordance with Sect 38(1)(c) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
